    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "200W LED Outdoor Floodlight - Avant Pro - Osram Chip OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835 - 5 Years",
    "reference":  "FLOSR200W-CW-91938",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDo you want to illuminate your garden, your terrace or your facade with the best quality and the lowest consumption? Then you need the \u003cstrong\u003e200W Outdoor LED Floodlight \u003c/strong\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eAvant Pro\u003c/strong\u003e - \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM Chip\u003c/strong\u003e. This spotlight offers you a powerful, uniform and long-lasting light, thanks to its OSRAM DURIS E 2835 chip, one of the most advanced on the market.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith this spotlight, you can enjoy high-performance \u003cstrong\u003eoutdoor lighting\u003c/strong\u003e, with savings of up to 80% on your electricity bill. In addition, its rugged \u003cstrong\u003eIK10\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eIP65\u003c/strong\u003e dust and water resistant design guarantees a long service life. Do not hesitate and get the OSRAM Chip Spotlight, order it now and receive it fast, and it also has\u003cstrong\u003e 5 YEARS WARRANTY!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eLED Outdoor Floodlight 200W - Avant Pro - OSRAM DURIS E 2835 Chip - 5-Year Warranty\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet ready to experience next generation lighting with the \u003cstrong\u003eLED Outdoor Floodlight - Avant Pro!\u003c/strong\u003e This stunning, state-of-the-art floodlight completely redefines your perception of brightness and energy efficiency. Precision engineered and equipped with state-of-the-art technology, this product is the perfect choice for those looking for exceptional outdoor lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt the heart of this floodlight is the renowned \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM DURIS E 2835 Chip\u003c/strong\u003e, a milestone in technological innovation. Thanks to its unique cutting-edge technology, this chip delivers exceptional performance that defies conventional brightness limits. With an astounding 140 lumens per watt (Lm/W) efficiency, this projector emits dazzling, crisp light that illuminates every corner of your outdoor environment with stunning clarity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersatility meets durability in the design of the LED Outdoor Floodlight - Avant Pro -. Precision manufactured using a combination of high quality aluminum and durable polycarbonate, this floodlight is designed to withstand the rigors of weather and time, ensuring consistent performance for years to come. Its \u003cstrong\u003eIK10\u003c/strong\u003e rating protects against impact and accidental damage, ensuring a long-term, worry-free lighting investment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInstallation has never been easier and safer. Equipped with an \u003cstrong\u003eIP67\u003c/strong\u003e connector, this floodlight connects to the mains quickly and efficiently, without compromising the integrity of the system. Whether illuminating gardens, facades, playgrounds or commercial spaces, this floodlight offers a lighting solution that perfectly suits your needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://www.factorled.com/img/cms/Ambientadas/Foco-Proyector-Exterior-LED-30W-NEW-EVOLUTION-IP65-Osram.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd that\u0027s not all, confidence is guaranteed! With a \u003cstrong\u003e5-year warranty\u003c/strong\u003e, you can rest assured that you are investing in a product that not only illuminates your environment, but also illuminates your peace of mind. The LED Outdoor Floodlight - Avant Pro is much more than just a floodlight; it is a statement of unmatched excellence, durability and performance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlus, its instant on/off feature gives you immediate illumination with no waiting time. Whether for special events, commercial installations or home use, you won\u0027t have to worry about waiting for the lights to turn on gradually. Simply flip the switch and enjoy bright illumination instantly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe IP65 protection of this floodlight makes it suitable for both indoor and outdoor use. Thanks to its protection rating, it is ready to withstand harsh weather conditions, such as rain, snow or dust. So no matter whether you need it to illuminate a garden, a facade or a commercial space, this floodlight is designed to withstand and continue to perform optimally.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur floodlight is IK10! Maximum resistance to shocks and inclement weather!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM CHIP LED\u003c/strong\u003e spotlight is versatile and can be used in a wide variety of applications. Some of the places where this spotlight can be used include:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eArchitectural lighting: It can be used to highlight and enhance the beauty of buildings, monuments, bridges and other architectural elements.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdvertising lighting: It is ideal for illuminating billboards, posters, signs and advertising panels, helping to capture the public\u0027s attention and highlight information.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDecorative lighting: It can be used to create decorative lighting effects in events, gardens, parks, squares, rest areas and other outdoor spaces.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCommercial area lighting: It is perfect for highlighting products in displays, shop windows, commercial galleries and stores, attracting customers\u0027 attention to the products or services offered.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResidential lighting: It can be used in patios, gardens, terraces and outdoor areas of homes, providing efficient and safe lighting for nighttime activities.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIndustrial lighting: It is suitable for illuminating work areas in factories, warehouses, workshops and industrial spaces, improving visibility and work safety.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSecurity lighting: It can be used in security lighting systems for outdoor or indoor areas, providing bright and clear illumination to detect possible risks.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Osram chip LED floodlight is an exceptional choice for those looking for quality, performance and efficiency in lighting. Its cutting-edge design, ability to reduce energy consumption and versatility in indoor and outdoor use make it the ideal choice for illuminating your architectural, advertising and decorative projects. Don\u0027t settle for less, choose cutting-edge lighting with the Avant Pro LED floodlight.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
